Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 05:43:17 +1100
Subject: [PATCH 19/25] Include <algorithm> in TestFontOverlapPrevention.cpp

GCC 16's libstdc++ no longer pulls std::find_if in through <vector> or
<string>, so the gfx gtests fail to compile on Fedora 45. Main already
has the include from bug 2054311.
---
 gfx/tests/gtest/TestFontOverlapPrevention.cpp | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/gfx/tests/gtest/TestFontOverlapPrevention.cpp b/gfx/tests/gtest/TestFontOverlapPrevention.cpp
index 566cbbda3a..17dbac9c0b 100644
--- a/gfx/tests/gtest/TestFontOverlapPrevention.cpp
+++ b/gfx/tests/gtest/TestFontOverlapPrevention.cpp
@@ -3,6 +3,7 @@
  */
 
 #include "gtest/gtest.h"
+#include <algorithm>
 #include <vector>
 #include <string>
 
